DTSTAMP:20261114T120409Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261203T183000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261203T213000
SUMMARY:Geneva 3D — Building a Living 3D Model of a Canton with AI Agents
  and Open Data
LOCATION:Tesla showroom\, Rue de la Confédération 8\, Geneva
DESCRIPTION:Arnaud Ricci on how he built Genève 3D\, a browser-based 3D mo
 del of the whole canton\, using AI agents and open data — with a live de
 monstration\, questions from the room and a non-alcoholic apéro. The talk
  is in French with English subtitles.\n\nOrganiser: Switzerland AI Communi
 ty with Romandy CTO\, hosted by Tesla\n\nDetails and registration: https:/
 /swissdataevents.ch/events/geneva-3d-switzerland-ai-community-2026/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/geneva-3d-switzerland-ai-community-20
 26/
